# Code release header: arm values, by the method of 02_cnv_v4.R, for luminal cells outside the first atlas version, in three samples.
# Input: the outputs of 01_pseudobulk_v4.R and 02_cnv_v4.R, a later cell table, its count-source manifest and the three samples' counts.
# A unit of at least 15 such cells gets a pseudobulk, and 20 half-splits at 50 cells or more. Each new pseudobulk gets a TMM factor on the 02_cnv_v4.R scale.
# The evidence step reads only the units of 50 or more cells.
# Output: NG_arm_values_v2.csv, read by the evidence step of the labeling rule (not included). Methods: Copy-number inference.
# NG_L5: L5 arm values for the No_Group units of L065, L076, L087, by the method of 01_pseudobulk_v4.R and 02_cnv_v4.R: variant P, reference options (a) same-library non-epithelial types of 50 or more cells, (b) pooled benign Luminal of the same chemistry, own patient included, (c) young-donor Luminal, (d) same-patient benign, normal or BPH. Values only, no event call. It writes NG_arm_values_v2.csv, which the evidence step of the labeling rule (D_scores_ae.R, not included) reads; read-only on its inputs. No subtype label and no label of the first atlas version is read. Extra, project choice: same-library host-epithelium controls, half-splits, arm r against same-library Luminal units.
